## Test Anti-Pattern Audit: Severity-Ranked Findings

This test suite is a textbook example of **"coverage theater"** — every production method is invoked, giving 95%+ line coverage, but almost nothing is actually *verified*.

---

### 🔴 Critical (P1) — Tests that can never catch bugs

| # | Test | Anti-Pattern | What it misses |
|---|------|-------------|----------------|
| 1 | `AddProduct_Works` (L17-21) | **No assertion at all** — fire-and-forget | Would pass even if `Save()` silently drops data |
| 2 | `UpdatePrice_Works` (L33-35) | **No assertion** | Price could stay at 9.99 or go negative — test still green |
| 3 | `RemoveProduct_Works` (L38-41) | **No assertion** | Product could still exist after delete |
| 4 | `GetProductCount_Works` (L63-66) | **No assertion + wrong state** | Count result discarded; empty catalog means `0` is never challenged |
| 5 | `ApplyBulkDiscount_Works` (L68-74) | **No assertion** | Discount math could be `* fraction` instead of `* (1-fraction)` — would never be caught |
| 6 | `ImportFromCsv_Works` (L85-88) | **No assertion** | Imported product is never retrieved to verify correctness |

### 🟠 High (P2) — Assertions that prove almost nothing

| # | Test | Anti-Pattern | Fix |
|---|------|-------------|-----|
| 7 | `GetProduct_Works` (L26-29) | **Assert.IsNotNull only** — verifies *something* came back, not that it's correct | Should assert `result.Sku == "SKU-001"`, `result.Price == 9.99m` |
| 8 | `SearchProducts_Works` (L46-52) | **Assert.IsNotNull on list** — an empty list is also non-null | Should assert `results.Count == 1` and `results[0].Name == "Widget"` |
| 9 | `ExportToCsv_Works` (L77-82) | **Assert.IsNotNull on string** — `""` is non-null | Should assert CSV contains `"SKU-001,Widget,9.99"` |
| 10 | `GetAllProducts_Works` (L55-60) | **Assert.IsNotNull on list** | Should assert `all.Count == 1` |

### 🟡 Medium (P3) — Missing negative/edge-case coverage

| # | Gap | Risk in production |
|---|-----|-------------------|
| 11 | No test for `UpdatePrice` on missing SKU | `KeyNotFoundException` path untested |
| 12 | No test for `GetProduct` returning `null` | Callers may not handle null |
| 13 | No test for `Search` with no matches | Empty-list behavior unverified |
| 14 | No test for `ImportFromCsv` with malformed input | `IndexOutOfRange` / `FormatException` in prod |
| 15 | No test for `ApplyBulkDiscount` with fraction ≥ 1 | Negative prices possible |

---

### Concrete Fixes (examples, not exhaustive)

```csharp
// P1 fix — AddProduct
[TestMethod]
